# --- PUBLIC-repo safety note ---
# knowledge-base/_private/ (the real-name map + HO provenance) is intentionally TRACKED in the PRIVATE
# repo — it is part of the full private copy. The PUBLIC build is produced by tools/sanitize.py, which
